                    <p>
                      Click <strong>Start Fuse</strong> to draw four charged cards. Select any two active cards and
                      press <strong>Fuse Selected</strong> to combine them into a hybrid. Each fusion triggers a surge that
                      might mint a bonus card, vent instability, or supercharge your hybrid. Hold when your chain feels hot
