                        <strong>Select</strong>: Tap two active cards. Their outlines light up to confirm the upcoming
                        merge. Hybrid cards remain in play and can be paired with the third card if desired.
                      </li>
                      <li>
                        <strong>Fuse</strong>: Instability = (value A + value B) ÷ 2 + the suit interaction modifier. Suit
                        effects: ♠ + ♥ = +2 · ♦ + ♣ = –1 · ♥ + ♦ = 0 · ♣ + ♠ = +1. All other pairings are neutral.
